<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Good Programming - Logo Redesign</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tgpLogoRedesign.css">
    <!-- Site-wide mobile overrides -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" media="(max-width: 768px)" href="/css/mobile.css">
    <!-- Icons (for back button, if needed elsewhere) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.15.3/css/all.min.css">

    <!-- Page-scoped mobile tweaks (do not affect desktop) -->
    <style>
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        /* Back button with safe area so it doesn't overlap content */
        .back-button {
            position: sticky;
            top: 8px;
            z-index: 40;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            font-size: .95rem;
            margin: 8px;
        }

        /* Intro */
        .content { padding: 0 12px; }
        .content h1 { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 6vw, 1.6rem); margin: 8px 0; text-align: center; }
        .content p  { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; }

        /* Previous attempts: stack columns */
        .previous-attempts {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
        }
        .previous-attempts .left h2 { 
            font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 4.8vw, 1.25rem);
            margin: 0 0 6px; 
            text-align: center;
        }
        .previous-attempts .left p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; }

        /* Center the video perfectly */
        .previous-attempts .right {
            display: grid;
            justify-items: center;   /* centra el contenido horizontalmente */
        }
        .previous-attempts .right video {
            width: 100%;             /* ocupa el ancho disponible del contenedor */
            max-width: 640px;        /* límite para no estirarse demasiado */
            aspect-ratio: 16/9;      /* mantiene proporción */
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        /* Examples: PDF + GIF stacked and responsive */
        .examples { padding: 12px; }
        .examples h2 { 
            font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 4.8vw, 1.25rem); 
            margin: 0 0 8px; 
            text-align: center; 
        }
        .media-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        /* make embeds slightly narrower as well and centered */
        .media-container iframe,
        .media-container img {
            width: 94%;
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: block;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .media-container iframe {
            aspect-ratio: 3/4;     /* readable portrait ratio on phones */
            height: auto;
            border: none;
        }
        .media-container img {
            height: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        /* Decision text */
        .final-decision { padding: 12px; }
        .final-decision p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }

        /* Final logo and carousel */
        .final-section { padding: 12px; }
        .logo-container img { width: 94%; max-width: 640px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }

        .carousel-container { overflow: hidden; }
        .carousel { width: 100%; }
        .slides {
            display: grid;
            grid-auto-flow: row;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .slides img { width: 94%; max-width: 640px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 auto; }

        /* Fullscreen modal: fit to screen */
        #imageModal { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.85); z-index: 100; }
        #imageModal .modal-content {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            width: auto;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: auto;
        }
        #imageModal .close {
            position: absolute;
            right: 12px;
            top: 8px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Back button -->
    <button class="back-button" onclick="window.history.back();">Go Back</button>

    <!-- Title and brief project description -->
    <div class="content">
        <h1>The Good Programming</h1>
        <p>This project was born from a color study on all the competition in the mobile programming IT sector in Spain.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Previous attempts section -->
    <section class="previous-attempts">
        <div class="left">
            <h2>Previous Attempts</h2>
            <p>I created an initial web version (which is no longer active) to present the project to the CEO of The Good Programming.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="right">
            <video controls>
                <source src="/Videos/tgp_logoRedesignOldWeb.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                Your browser does not support video playback.
            </video>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Redesign process examples section -->
    <section class="examples">
        <h2>Some examples of the redesign process and color tests</h2>
        <div class="media-container">
            <iframe src="/pdfs/TheGoodProgramming-redesign.pdf" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            <img src="/gifs/TheGoodProgramming.gif" alt="Redesign process and color tests">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final decision section -->
    <section class="final-decision">
        <p>The decision was made to move away from the recognizable IT symbols and jargon and opt for a much more serious logo that is easily recognizable and reproducible, with a reduced color palette to facilitate merchandising and printing.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Final logo and carousel section -->
    <section class="final-section">
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="/Images/TGP/tgp_finalLogo.svg" alt="Final Logo of The Good Programming">
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-container">
            <div class="carousel">
                <div class="slides">
                    <img src="/Images/TGP/tgp_mobilesMockUp.png" alt="Mobile Mock-up">
                    <img src="/Images/TGP/tgp_backPackMockUp.png" alt="Backpack Mock-up">
                    <img src="/Images/TGP/tgp_cupsMockUp.png" alt="Cup Mock-up">
                    <img src="/Images/TGP/tgp_finalLogoBackpack.jpg" alt="Logo on Backpack">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Fullscreen image modal -->
    <div id="imageModal">
        <span class="close">&times;</span>
        <img class="modal-content" id="modalImage">
    </div>

    <!-- JavaScript for fullscreen modal -->
    <script>
        // Select all images from the carousel
        const carouselImages = document.querySelectorAll('.slides img');
        const modal = document.getElementById('imageModal');
        const modalImg = document.getElementById('modalImage');
        const closeModal = document.getElementsByClassName('close')[0];

        // Add click event to each image
        carouselImages.forEach(image => {
            image.onclick = function() {
                modal.style.display = 'block';
                modalImg.src = this.src;  // Display clicked image in the modal
            };
        });

        // Close the modal on 'X' click
        closeModal.onclick = function() {
            modal.style.display = 'none';
        };

        // Close the modal when clicking outside the image
        modal.onclick = function(event) {
            if (event.target === modal) {
                modal.style.display = 'none';
            }
        };
    </script>

</body>
</html>
